msgstr "Smazat kolekci"

msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete this collection? This action cannot be "
"undone."
msgstr "Opravdu chcete smazat tuto kolekci? Tuto akci nelze vrátit zpět."

msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete this section? This action cannot be undone."
msgstr "Opravdu chcete smazat tuto sekci? Tuto akci nelze vrátit zpět."
